 "doc": "Ascent of the stress flow at 1067 float32 directions: pole and antimeridian cyclones, the signed-zero equator, a 0.02 and a 1.5 radius, a zero-omega cyclone (the ascent weight does not depend on omega), a cleared (negative weight) cyclone, a tropical storm and a high on one center. Tolerance rtol 8e-5, atol 8e-6: over the multi-vortex float32 flows the float64-promoted computation differs by at most 9.5e-7, a one-ulp nudge of the directions by 2.9e-6 (0.73 of the default band, the Earth flow with its tropical eyes), reversing the vortex order (another float32 summation order) by 4.8e-7; tolerance 10 times the worst. Conventions of cloudgen.sphere read here: lonlat_to_dir(lon, lat) = (cos lat cos lon, cos lat sin lon, sin lat) with float64 numpy cos and sin (right-handed, z north, longitude grows east; a vortex center is that direction); normalize(v) = v / |v| (plain division, no epsilon: a zero vector gives NaN).",
